+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured, from a prior session's transcript (trust 1, tool-observed; not in git log):
+
+- Before: SessionStart health gate cost **11.9 ms**.
+- Change made at the same time: `quick_check` taken off the read path, plus a
+  `fts_rows` counter and a body `CHECK` added.
+- After: SessionStart health gate cost **1.05 ms**.
+
+Source: `[muninn:episode] #79`, evidence at
+`~/.local/share/muninn-bench/seed-14a6ab47-frozen.jsonl:22559233`.
+
+**Caveat:** the record above gives the before/after cost but does not state
+that these were p50 figures or that the store held 5k records at the time of
+measurement. Querying `muninn why "SessionStart hook p50 5k record store
+quick_check"` returned only this same circumstantial (trust < 2) record and
+was marked `insufficient`. So the 11.9 ms → 1.05 ms numbers are real
+measurements, but a p50-on-5k-records claim specifically is not corroborated
+here — do not treat it as confirmed, and do not substitute an estimate.
